.TH MSGCTL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
msgctl \- control a System V message queue
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/msg.h>
.B int msgctl(int id, int command, struct msqid_ds* buffer);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
IPC_STAT reads queue metadata; IPC_SET updates permitted fields; IPC_RMID
removes the queue.  Pass NULL when no buffer is required.  The structure uses
the Linux x86\-64 layout.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the command result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR msgget (3crunch),
.BR msgctl (2)
